{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionSU3Stabilizer","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionSU3Stabilizer","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivationProperties","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivationsUpperBound","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Dimension.RankNullity"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.finrank_su3_eq_8_iff_rank_eq_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.finrank_su3_eq_8_iff_rank_eq_6","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/OctonionSU3Stabilizer.lean#L91-L103","doc":"**The `S⁶ = G₂/SU(3)` gate:** the colour stabilizer is `8`-dimensional (the\nLie algebra of `SU(3)`) **iff** the evaluation has rank `6` (`= dim S⁶`). The\n`rank = 6` value is exact-arithmetic certified (merged probe); this is the clean\nLean reduction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.finrank_su3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.finrank_su3","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/OctonionSU3Stabilizer.lean#L81-L89","doc":"**Rank–nullity for the stabilizer:** `dim 𝔰𝔲(3) = 14 − rank(ev_e)`, using\n`dim Der(𝕆) = 14`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.mem_su3_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.mem_su3_iff","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/OctonionSU3Stabilizer.lean#L78-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.su3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.su3","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/OctonionSU3Stabilizer.lean#L73-L76","doc":"**The colour stabilizer `𝔰𝔲(3) = {D ∈ Der(𝕆) : D(e) = 0}`** — the derivations\nfixing `e`. For a unit imaginary `e` this is the Günaydin–Gürsey colour\n`SU(3) ⊂ G₂ = Aut(𝕆)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.evOct_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.evOct_apply","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/OctonionSU3Stabilizer.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.evOct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivations.evOct","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/OctonionSU3Stabilizer.lean#L64-L69","doc":"**Evaluation of a derivation at a fixed octonion `e`**: `D ↦ D(e)`, linear in\n`D`. The stabilizer `𝔰𝔲(3)` is its kernel. ","signatureChunk":0}]}